    <code code="10187-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Review of systems Narrative - Reported"/>
    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Tired; temperature up to 37.5 C</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Vomiting, now less frequent, and watery diarrhea without blood</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Positive</td><td>Passing less urine; no dysuria; no bleeding or leaking fluid</td></tr><tr><td>Obstetric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Painless tightenings about twice an hour; no pelvic pressure; both babies moving</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No headache or visual change; light-headed on standing</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

